WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:08.601
FluentAI remembers your level and weak topics.
This lesson focuses on the Spanish past tense.

2
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:21.009
OpenAI builds a lesson around yesterday, with
useful vocabulary, examples, and six practice
questions.

3
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.525
Here, I answer the quiz and deliberately write
mañana where the question asks for yesterday.

4
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.677
The app explains the mistake, awards fifty-five
experience points, and adds the weak areas to
the review queue.

5
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:52.940
The text tutor picks up the same goal, asking
what I did yesterday to reinforce the lesson.

6
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.013
I reply with another deliberate error: using the
present tense, voy, after ayer.

7
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:11.997
The tutor corrects voy to fui, preserves the
meaning, and asks what I bought. It saves that
correction for review.

8
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.141
The memory inspector shows the saved learner
state, including the correction and review
queue.

9
00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:30.428
Reloading keeps the experience points and
scheduled reviews, ready for the next session.
